    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "引導學生自主探索學習及培育永續及共善的人文素養，從而協助學生理解永續與共善如何鏈結商管專業。",
      "describe_en": "Guiding students to independently explore learning and cultivating sustainable and ethical humanities attributes, thereby assisting students in understanding how sustainability and ethics are linked to business management expertise."
